\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, stand among us
\par In Thy risen power;
\par Let this time of worship
\par Be a hallowed hour.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Breathe the Holy Spirit
\par Into every heart;
\par Bid the fears and sorrows,
\par From each soul depart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thus with quickened footsteps
\par We'll pursue our way,
\par Watching for the dawning
\par Of eternal day.
\par                    Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

